deck/reviews/kdr-codex-r2.log:513:-| `mk20-use-kd` | (KD replacement, only relevant with `FEATURE_KBD=1`) **debug/rescue-only manual override**: keep stock KeyboardDevice, do not start `mk20d kbd` / `bin/mk20-kbd`. Same as `/data/mk20/use-kd` (adb/ssh). There is no automatic fallback to stock KD: mk20-kbd is restarted with backoff, and a release whose mk20-kbd crash-loops on probation fails selftest and is rolled back A/B. Takes effect at the next boot (or now: `touch /tmp/mk20-kbd-stop; killall mk20-kbd; /etc/init.d/qt_app2 start`) |
